public import FeitThompson.BGsection1.corollary_1_12

open scoped Pointwise

public section

/-
**Kind**: Theorem
**Note**: Lemma 1.14
**Stmt**:
Let `p` be a prime.
Let `T` be a `p`-subgroup of a finite group `G`.
Let `M` be a normal `p'`-subgroup of `G`.
Let `C = C_G(T)` and `N = N_G(T)`.
Then
`C_{G/M}(TM/M) = CM/M`
and
`N_{G/M}(TM/M) = NM/M`.
-/


end
